<section id="v4-review" class="provider-review" aria-labelledby="v4-title">
<h2 id="v4-title">Rolling research · four evidence tracks</h2>
<p class="note">Open the separately supplied <strong>B055_V4_PRIVATE_REVIEW.json</strong> when an actual owner return provides it; the dated B054 review schema remains supported to inspect rolling research, typed operation counts, metrics and source gaps. A prepared package or a successful local test does not establish owner execution. The original game report, full-season schedule and input eligibility views below remain independent.</p>
<div class="upload-row"><div><label for="v4-summary-file">Private V4 review JSON · up to 16 MiB</label><input id="v4-summary-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></div><button id="clear-v4" class="secondary" type="button" disabled>Clear rolling review</button></div>
<p id="v4-status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">No V4 owner review loaded. Compiled capabilities still require authenticated owner evidence.</p>
<div id="v4-content" hidden>
<div id="v4-summary-cards" class="freshness-grid"></div><div id="v4-execution"></div>
__REFRESH_REVIEW_PANEL__
__PROJECTION_REVIEW_PANEL__
<div class="toolbar"><div class="control"><label for="v4-track">Evidence track</label><select id="v4-track"><option value="all">All four, kept separate</option><option value="original_frozen_issued">Original frozen issues</option><option value="historically_reconstructed_rolling">Historical rolling reconstruction</option><option value="genuinely_future_issued_rolling">Genuinely future rolling issues</option><option value="model_market_source_only_reference">Model, market and source references</option></select></div><div class="control"><label for="v4-league">Metric league</label><select id="v4-league"><option value="all">Both leagues, kept separate</option><option value="ncaam">Men</option><option value="ncaaw">Women</option></select></div><div class="control"><label for="v4-target">Metric target</label><select id="v4-target"><option value="all">Every supplied target</option><option value="win">Winner probability</option><option value="margin">Point margin</option><option value="total">Total points</option></select></div><div class="control"><label for="v4-season">Metric season end year</label><select id="v4-season"><option value="all">All supplied seasons</option></select></div></div>
<p class="note">Only supplied evaluated populations receive numeric metrics. Selection policy, target, horizon and evidence track remain separate. Missing values stay unavailable; source-only rows cannot become scores. Counts below are the authored population N and do not establish one common physical-game cohort, a model improvement or promotion.</p>
<div class="data-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>League</th><th>Season</th><th>Target</th><th>Evidence track</th><th>Selector</th><th>Horizon minutes</th><th>Authored N</th><th>Accuracy</th><th>Log loss</th><th>Brier</th><th>MAE</th><th>RMSE</th><th>Mean error</th><th>ECE · ten bins</th></tr></thead><tbody id="v4-metric-rows"></tbody></table></div>
<div class="pager"><p id="v4-metric-count" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="buttons"><button id="v4-metric-previous" class="secondary" type="button" disabled>Previous metrics</button><button id="v4-metric-next" class="secondary" type="button" disabled>Next metrics</button></div></div>
<h3>Inspect preserved per-game evidence</h3><p class="note">The review summary names exact parts; it does not contain every game row. Download the corresponding private part from the owner handoff, then select it below. This browser verifies the compressed and decoded hashes, byte counts and row count. It makes no remote request. One loaded part cannot prove full-stream or full-season completeness.</p>
<div class="toolbar"><div class="control"><label for="v4-stream">Preserved stream</label><select id="v4-stream"></select></div><div class="control"><label for="v4-part">Exact evidence part</label><select id="v4-part"></select></div><div class="control"><label for="v4-part-file">Matching gzip JSONL part</label><input id="v4-part-file" type="file" accept=".gz,application/gzip" disabled></div></div>
<p id="v4-part-status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="v4-stream-proof"></div><div class="pager"><p id="v4-part-count" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="buttons"><button id="v4-part-previous" class="secondary" type="button" disabled>Previous evidence rows</button><button id="v4-part-next" class="secondary" type="button" disabled>Next evidence rows</button></div></div><div id="v4-part-rows"></div>
